🤖 AI Email Assistant

An AI-powered Email Assistant built using n8n, OpenAI (GPT) and Gmail.

🚀 Project Overview

This project uses AI to generate professional, polite and helpful replies to customer emails and automatically saves them as Gmail drafts.

✨ Features

- Takes customer email details as input.
- Generates professional replies using OpenAI.
- Creates email drafts in Gmail automatically.
- Allows human review before sending.

🛠️ Technologies Used

- n8n – Workflow Automation
- OpenAI GPT – AI Text Generation
- Gmail – Email Draft Creation

⚙️ Workflow

1. Manual Trigger
2. Edit Fields – Customer email input
3. Basic LLM Chain – AI reply generation
4. Gmail – Create Draft

📌 How It Works

The workflow receives customer email information, processes it using an AI language model, generates a suitable reply and saves the response as a Gmail draft.

🎯 Learning Outcomes

- Understanding AI automation
- Working with LLMs
- Building workflows in n8n
- Integrating OpenAI with Gmail

